# LIMPET: landing from a warp throws out flares to either side along the
# surface, two tiles each way, and they hurt what is there.
game limpet
wait 5
cheat level 0
cheat nofoes
cheat pos 30 15 0
wait 2
cheat foe 1 32 1 4
cheat foe 1 36 1 4
expect foes_1 == 2
press B 1
expect ty == 1
expect foes_1 == 1
